{"name": "Code RAPID", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a Distant World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the distant world of Ondarea, war machines walk the planet long after the collapse. Discover decaying cities, snow-choked military outposts, and industrial relics of a lost age, each mission peeling back the truth behind the cause of the drone lands, and questioning the purpose of a connection that never truly existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/e77d5f2f30b44ac006908d661ad69552.poster.avif?t=1785970137\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/e77d5f2f30b44ac006908d661ad69552.webm?t=1785970137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/e77d5f2f30b44ac006908d661ad69552.mp4?t=1785970137\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stylish Acrobatic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leap, boost, and strike with precision. Chain mobility and attacks to dismantle enemies in fast-paced encounters that reward timing, spacing, and control. Use everything you've got to complete your missions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/1d0114f415f14c8d389108f893066b9f.poster.avif?t=1785970137\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/1d0114f415f14c8d389108f893066b9f.webm?t=1785970137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/1d0114f415f14c8d389108f893066b9f.mp4?t=1785970137\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deep Build Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your Knight\u2014body, weapons, and tuning. Each part affects how you fight and what you're capable of. Adapt your loadout, craft machines tailored to your playstyle and mission demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/926f924fa1feaf5c42cf6103c2c030ca.poster.avif?t=1785970137\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/926f924fa1feaf5c42cf6103c2c030ca.webm?t=1785970137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/926f924fa1feaf5c42cf6103c2c030ca.mp4?t=1785970137\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Code RAPID is a Third-Person Action Mecha game with the focus on real-time high-mobility movement. Fight on the Ondarean front to uncover mysteries of a forgotten planet. Complete missions to earn weapons and parts to build a mech that truly suits your playstyle with deep customization systems.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/1a3290fd486f57664959c9145a80b5beb4ddf22d/header.jpg?t=1785970137", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Mechs", "Action", "Character Customization", "Third-Person Shooter", "Singleplayer", "Sci-fi"], "developers": "HitBreak", "publishers": "HitBreak", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3499590", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_des